{"id":"4b158bieoNuDCdaz","meta":{"instanceId":"df0c304588f29286f56b5a39e8b38e150bb25bf750624d5621e0a2ad14747047","templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"name":"Monitor Instagram locations and build a local creator lead list with Google Sheets and Telegram","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"8f2c918b-67b5-4484-b0c9-09bc0631cf54","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2256,-48],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## Monitor Instagram locations and build a local creator lead list with Google Sheets and Telegram\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow monitors selected Instagram locations on a recurring schedule, finds recent posts via an external location/search API, and builds a local creator lead list in Google Sheets. It also provides a setup form for searching and saving locations to monitor, then sends Telegram summaries when new posts or creator updates are found. Errors during searches or sheet writes are captured or reported so the location loop can continue and failures can be noticed.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and configure the spreadsheet URL in the Set Config node.\n- Create or verify the required Google Sheets tabs, especially Locations, Creators, and Posts, with columns matching the workflow’s row-building code.\n- Connect Telegram bot credentials and set the target Telegram chat ID in the Set Config node.\n- Configure access to the Recent Reborn API endpoints used for location lookup and post search, including any required authentication in the HTTP Request nodes.\n- Publish or test the Location Setup Form, save desired locations to the Locations tab, then enable the 30-minute schedule trigger for ongoing monitoring.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the schedule interval, location activity rules, post cutoff window, Google Sheets column mappings, and Telegram message formatting in the schedule, code, and Set Config nodes."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"602d2f6e-49b8-493e-8725-57ddbedf594a","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2816,48],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":992,"content":"## Workflow entry triggers\n\nStarts the workflow from the setup form, the 30-minute schedule, or a manual test run."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"7276f8e3-0a34-46c0-acc1-755f6ee47158","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3088,512],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Configure and route\n\nSets shared configuration values, then routes execution between setup-form handling and normal scheduled monitoring."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a6e52dd5-bd21-434c-b7ec-75e1b6161d9c","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3552,32],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":496,"content":"## Lookup location matches\n\nSearches the external API for matching Instagram locations, builds choices for the form, and handles lookup failure or no-result outcomes."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8d9820e0-8214-4d76-bc63-0947f0cb5b33","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4224,-48],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":848,"height":496,"content":"## Save selected locations\n\nLets the user choose matching locations, converts selections into sheet rows, saves them, and shows final form messages."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"15a8ce67-e33e-4b44-a712-e8cefe1ea42e","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3552,624],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Load monitored locations\n\nReads configured locations from Google Sheets and turns active rows into location search jobs with cutoffs."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a35cf41a-24d4-42d0-a080-98f5ff9e4b6f","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4000,560],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":464,"content":"## Check setup requirement\n\nDetermines whether any active locations exist and sends a Telegram reminder if setup is still needed."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"72b81006-405c-4e75-94dc-68cb38cd60b2","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4464,704],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":384,"height":320,"content":"## Prepare creator context\n\nReads existing creators and rebuilds the active location jobs after the Google Sheets read replaces the current items."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8522e21f-02bf-45c1-90b2-909fc2e0d254","name":"Sticky Note8","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4880,688],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":624,"content":"## Search each location\n\nLoops over active locations and requests recent Instagram posts for each location from the search API."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2c150186-0737-4276-9dd3-960f5fc94cc5","name":"Sticky Note9","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[5152,832],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":608,"content":"## Normalize search results\n\nReattaches location metadata to returned posts or creates marker items for failed searches so the loop can finish cleanly."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a13173a7-0dc0-42f2-a959-353ccc7eb363","name":"Sticky Note10","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[5424,704],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Process post summary\n\nConsolidates loop results, identifies new posts and creator changes, and decides whether post rows need to be written."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"13f38ccb-5f8c-405e-86f6-29cee0bcbb13","name":"Sticky Note11","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[5872,608],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":624,"height":304,"content":"## Append new posts\n\nSplits new post rows, appends them to the Posts sheet, and restores the single summary item for downstream steps."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"f8d97b26-0fb8-42af-8168-a1ba0d93dcd5","name":"Sticky Note12","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[6528,608],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":848,"height":432,"content":"## Upsert creator records\n\nChecks for creator updates, splits creator rows, upserts them into Google Sheets, and restores the run summary afterward."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"eed5c9e9-9da2-4e17-b581-0a9e6d8805c4","name":"Sticky Note13","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[7408,800],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":400,"height":320,"content":"## Update location state\n\nSplits per-location state updates and writes the latest monitoring state back to the Locations sheet."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"08d424ab-e142-4b28-814f-85b242ba9321","name":"Sticky Note14","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[7840,704],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":400,"height":320,"content":"## Send Telegram summary\n\nBuilds escaped HTML Telegram notifications and sends the monitoring summary to the configured chat."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"dcae238c-a637-4c65-b5b7-4ab7228bef0c","name":"Sticky Note15","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[7584,1152],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":336,"content":"## Report sheet failures\n\nSends a Telegram alert when writing posts, creators, or location state to Google Sheets fails."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"f9851462-f6f9-4914-8b59-2d2a016f8a4c","name":"When Location Setup Form Submitted","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","position":[2864,224],"webhookId":"67bb1cc0-0532-4779-aa36-69f4cbb1f6bb","parameters":{"options":{"path":"instagram-location-setup","buttonLabel":"Find locations","appendAttribution":false},"formTitle":"Instagram location setup","formFields":{"values":[{"fieldLabel":"Location search","placeholder":"Berlin, Germany","requiredField":true}]},"formDescription":"Type a place name. On the next page you choose which Instagram locations to monitor."},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"2e1efaee-87e3-4e12-b705-9e5ef7c5ea65","name":"Every 30 Minutes Trigger","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[2864,672],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"minutes","minutesInterval":30}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"03344aa1-49f8-4a5d-a9eb-1ae74c4acd7a","name":"Manual Workflow Test Trigger","type":"n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger","position":[2864,880],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"213e82ce-0121-4fe1-bb39-fa4481e38246","name":"Set Configuration Parameters","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","notes":"formats: all | reels | photos\nleadMinLikes: likes on one post for an account to enter the Creators tab\nregularThreshold: posts seen before an account is a 'Regular'\nviralLikes: instant alert threshold (likes at discovery)","position":[3136,672],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"cd216514-8add-4cd2-8b3e-4fc1e8cfdfcf","name":"sheetUrl","type":"string","value":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_h5ur2Qu7NyEqwiH9TV02B8DCTWShVIz1Xl5gRTi-cg/edit?gid=0#gid=0"},{"id":"f8c16592-d9b9-416f-a060-8173702d8b38","name":"telegramChatId","type":"string","value":"5665199022"},{"id":"4805cbf7-5eee-4d60-9746-eb8f880ba307","name":"setupFormUrl","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"20d9ac0d-5bfb-449a-8b11-b6d3da73c98a","name":"formats","type":"string","value":"all"},{"id":"2961d481-9fa3-4f50-a82e-2236381c8bf6","name":"firstRunLookbackHours","type":"number","value":6},{"id":"d7598236-0def-44e1-86c5-647ad7fce67d","name":"overlapMinutes","type":"number","value":60},{"id":"80ae5940-491a-4a8e-b4ae-20b05ace6c3e","name":"leadMinLikes","type":"number","value":50},{"id":"b297c03d-7460-429e-99c7-9d5f70cb19d2","name":"viralLikes","type":"number","value":500},{"id":"305e6535-b4d5-447c-a05c-49eb24b40ec3","name":"regularThreshold","type":"number","value":3},{"id":"58c9d337-+1234567890c64636f0c9","name":"sendDigest","type":"boolean","value":true}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"1a47e074-895c-4a63-bd04-54879e83e83e","name":"If Setup Form Submission","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[3360,672],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"8d1dc26e-80b3-4df3-8dba-d7aaeb5eb99f","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json['Location search'] !== undefined ? 'yes' : 'no' }}","rightValue":"yes"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f1cc7a47-3cc5-408d-8913-fc84ee1c6bdf","name":"Fetch Location Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[3600,224],"parameters":{"url":"https://app.recentreborn.com/api/v1/locations","options":{},"sendQuery":true,"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpHeaderAuth","queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"query","value":"={{ $json['Location search'] }}"}]}},"credentials":{"httpHeaderAuth":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Header Auth account"}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"2825b203-3a96-4e9b-9b3e-36dc827acf4a","name":"Generate Location Choices","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3824,160],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Turn the /locations response into a multi-select form page.\nconst body = $json || {};\nconst query = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json['Location search'];\n\nif (!Array.isArray(body.locations)) {\n  return [{ json: { found: false, query, reason: 'unexpected response' } }];\n}\n\nconst choices = body.locations\n  .filter(l => l && l.id !== null && l.id !== undefined)\n  .slice(0, 30)\n  .map(l => ({ id: Number(l.id), name: String(l.name || l.id), label: `${l.name} (ID ${l.id})` }));\n\nif (choices.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: { found: false, query } }];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    found: true,\n    query,\n    choices,\n    formFields: [{\n      fieldLabel: 'Locations',\n      fieldType: 'dropdown',\n      multiselect: true,\n      requiredField: true,\n      fieldOptions: { values: choices.map(c => ({ option: c.label })) }\n    }]\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a08af326-e494-4cd5-a019-96072376c750","name":"If Locations Found","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[4048,160],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"49e5f9d2-7707-4c28-8e4e-1f89e9a30167","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.found ? 'yes' : 'no' }}","rightValue":"yes"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a1f97036-d119-43c2-86a0-d058d1f735cc","name":"Select Locations Form","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[4272,80],"webhookId":"60076071-00c6-4846-9b46-990901dbb91d","parameters":{"options":{"formTitle":"Choose locations to monitor","buttonLabel":"Save and start monitoring","formDescription":"Select one or more Instagram locations. You can add more later by running this form again."},"defineForm":"json","jsonOutput":"={{ JSON.stringify($json.formFields) }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"61354baa-35f2-4ad6-a37b-fc20df6a9b6c","name":"Prepare Rows for Locations","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4480,80],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Map the selected labels back to location IDs and build rows for the Locations tab.\n// Only config columns are written, so the monitoring state of an existing location is kept.\nconst raw = $json['Locations'];\nconst selected = Array.isArray(raw) ? raw : (raw ? [raw] : []);\nconst choices = $('Generate Location Choices').first().json.choices || [];\nconst query = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json['Location search'];\nconst now = new Date().toISOString();\n\nconst rows = choices\n  .filter(c => selected.includes(c.label))\n  .map(c => ({\n    json: {\n      'Location ID': c.id,\n      'Location Name': c.name,\n      'Search Query': query,\n      'Active': 'yes',\n      'Added At': now\n    }\n  }));\n\nif (rows.length === 0) {\n  throw new Error('No location selected. Go back and pick at least one location.');\n}\nreturn rows;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"d9c52a98-2298-4edc-864f-8152bed2fbfb","name":"Upsert Locations in Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[4704,80],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[{"id":"Location ID","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Location ID","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Location Name","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Location Name","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Search Query","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Search Query","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Active","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Active","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Added At","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Added At","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":["Location ID"],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{"cellFormat":"RAW"},"operation":"appendOrUpdate","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Locations"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"a87110e6-9f3e-4921-82ee-faa001a020bf","name":"Form Saved Acknowledgment","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[4928,80],"webhookId":"d36e9ea2-6183-4e70-bfec-ce713010a376","parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"completion","completionTitle":"Locations saved","completionMessage":"={{ $('Prepare Rows for Locations').all().length }} location(s) saved. Monitoring picks them up on the next scheduled run. To pause a location, set Active to \"no\" in the Locations tab."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"da8034a2-5680-48b6-9a47-2f8c1fd4b057","name":"Form No Match Acknowledgment","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[4272,272],"webhookId":"00528bc5-a21a-4ee4-b3a8-b45cb139c68c","parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"completion","completionTitle":"No locations found","completionMessage":"=No Instagram location matched \"{{ $json.query }}\". Try a more specific name, for example \"Berlin, Germany\" or the name of a venue."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"fa368b79-a253-4943-94d6-12235bf67c04","name":"Form Lookup Failed Acknowledgment","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[3824,352],"webhookId":"cbfed985-7a49-4100-9a3a-f0f08d799fc8","parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"completion","completionTitle":"Lookup failed","completionMessage":"The RecentReborn location lookup failed. Check the API credential in the workflow and try again."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"cc2bb030-7a8b-4e06-9cc5-1b0cbfa3f727","name":"Read Locations from Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[3600,784],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Locations"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"5b2f9cc0-fef8-41f9-be53-c1abc1d6f8b8","name":"Select Active Location Jobs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3824,784],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Read the Locations tab and turn every active row into a search job with its own cutoff.\n// If nothing is configured yet, emit one setup reminder (max once per 24 h on scheduled runs).\nconst cfg = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json;\nconst num = (v, d) => { const n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? n : d; };\nconst overlapMs = num(cfg.overlapMinutes, 60) * 60 * 1000;\nconst lookbackMs = num(cfg.firstRunLookbackHours, 6) * 3600 * 1000;\nconst inactive = ['no', 'false', '0', 'off', 'paused'];\n\nconst active = $input.all()\n  .map(r => r.json || {})\n  .filter(r => String(r['Location ID'] ?? '').trim() !== '')\n  .filter(r => !inactive.includes(String(r['Active'] ?? 'yes').trim().toLowerCase()));\n\nif (active.length > 0) {\n  return active.map(r => {\n    const lastPostAt = String(r['Last Post At'] || '').trim();\n    const lastMs = Date.parse(lastPostAt);\n    const cutoffMs = isNaN(lastMs) ? Date.now() - lookbackMs : lastMs - overlapMs;\n    return {\n      json: {\n        setupNeeded: false,\n        locationId: Number(r['Location ID']),\n        locationName: String(r['Location Name'] || r['Location ID']),\n        lastPostAt: isNaN(lastMs) ? '' : lastPostAt,\n        recentIds: String(r['Recent Post IDs'] || '').split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean),\n        cutoff: new Date(cutoffMs).toISOString()\n      }\n    };\n  });\n}\n\nconst store = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst isManual = $execution.mode === 'manual';\nconst lastReminder = Date.parse(store.lastSetupReminderAt || '');\nif (!isManual && !isNaN(lastReminder) && Date.now() - lastReminder < 24 * 3600 * 1000) {\n  return [];\n}\nif (!isManual) store.lastSetupReminderAt = new Date().toISOString();\n\nconst link = /^https?:\\/\\//.test(cfg.setupFormUrl || '')\n  ? `\\n\\nOpen the setup form: ${cfg.setupFormUrl}`\n  : '\\n\\nOpen the production URL of the \"Location Setup Form\" node to pick your locations.';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    setupNeeded: true,\n    telegramChatId: cfg.telegramChatId,\n    text: `📍 <b>No active Instagram locations configured.</b>\\n\\nThe monitor is running but has nothing to search yet.${link}`\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"0b562347-002d-41c2-8041-f680f2a5356c","name":"If Setup Required","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[4048,864],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"33c8d9da-fe20-4d14-9374-aea470690e86","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.setupNeeded ? 'yes' : 'no' }}","rightValue":"yes"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"5f5cc438-b1fb-4f4e-ae82-2af08d4f55dd","name":"Notify Setup Reminder via Telegram","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[4288,720],"webhookId":"afccdc14-ea00-4b94-a066-51089b46a448","parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.text }}","chatId":"={{ $json.telegramChatId }}","additionalFields":{"parse_mode":"HTML","appendAttribution":false,"disable_web_page_preview":true}},"credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Telegram account"}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"cc748164-c560-478a-be66-cb24cf47bc9c","name":"Fetch Creators from Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[4512,864],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Creators"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"0d21083b-589c-4850-ac0d-ccedc6bb346c","name":"Create Search Jobs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4704,864],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Re-emit the active locations (the Creators read in between replaced the items).\nreturn $('Select Active Location Jobs').all().map(i => ({\n  json: {\n    locationId: i.json.locationId,\n    locationName: i.json.locationName,\n    cutoff: i.json.cutoff\n  }\n}));"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"79bbf104-be92-4299-9ed7-d172845e44a1","name":"Process Locations in Batches","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches","position":[4928,864],"parameters":{"options":{}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"bd46e819-dfbb-45e3-9743-93d2800500db","name":"Fetch Posts by Location","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[4960,1152],"parameters":{"url":"https://app.recentreborn.com/api/v1/search/location","options":{"pagination":{"pagination":{"parameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"pagination_token","value":"={{ $response.body.next_pagination_token }}"}]},"maxRequests":3,"requestInterval":300,"limitPagesFetched":true,"completeExpression":"={{ !$response.body.next_pagination_token || (($response.body.results || []).some(p => p.posted_at && $json.cutoff && Date.parse(p.posted_at) < Date.parse($json.cutoff))) }}","paginationCompleteWhen":"other"}}},"sendQuery":true,"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpHeaderAuth","queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"location_id","value":"={{ $json.locationId }}"}]}},"credentials":{"httpHeaderAuth":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Header Auth account"}},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"waitBetweenTries":3000},{"id":"2387f2e1-7ad0-4cf4-a328-b2cf5e66f0aa","name":"Assign Location Tags to Results","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[5200,1072],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// One loop iteration = one location. Re-attach the location to every post.\n// Always return at least one item, otherwise the loop stops and skips the remaining locations.\nconst job = $('Process Locations in Batches').first().json;\nconst out = [];\n\nfor (const page of $input.all()) {\n  const body = page.json || {};\n  if (!Array.isArray(body.results)) {\n    return [{ json: { _kind: 'error', locationId: job.locationId, locationName: job.locationName,\n      message: 'Unexpected response (no results array): ' + JSON.stringify(body).slice(0, 200) } }];\n  }\n  for (const post of body.results) {\n    out.push({ json: { _kind: 'post', locationId: job.locationId, locationName: job.locationName, ...post } });\n  }\n}\n\nif (out.length === 0) out.push({ json: { _kind: 'empty', locationId: job.locationId, locationName: job.locationName } });\nreturn out;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"396382e7-b129-4ee1-9559-ffea3d26e54f","name":"Log Search Errors","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[5200,1280],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Turn a failed request into a marker item so the loop finishes and errors are reported together.\nconst job = $('Process Locations in Batches').first().json;\nconst err = $input.first().json.error;\nconst message = (err && (err.message || err.description)) || (typeof err === 'string' ? err : JSON.stringify(err || {}));\nreturn [{ json: { _kind: 'error', locationId: job.locationId, locationName: job.locationName, message: String(message).slice(0, 300) } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"aa23c7cd-a882-4c82-83a8-72d0a3292455","name":"Analyze New Instagram Posts","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[5472,864],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Core logic. Produces ONE summary item with:\n//   postRows      -> Posts tab (append)\n//   creatorRows   -> Creators tab (upsert by Author ID)\n//   locationRows  -> Locations tab (per-location state: watermark, recent IDs, health)\n//   alerts/digest -> Telegram\nconst cfg = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json;\nconst items = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst locations = $('Select Active Location Jobs').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst num = (v, d) => { const n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? n : d; };\nconst leadMinLikes = num(cfg.leadMinLikes, 50);\nconst viralLikes = num(cfg.viralLikes, 500);\nconst regularThreshold = num(cfg.regularThreshold, 3);\nconst formats = String(cfg.formats || 'all').toLowerCase();\nconst KEEP_IDS = 300;\nconst nowIso = new Date().toISOString();\n\nconst postIdFromUrl = url => {\n  const m = String(url || '').match(/instagram\\.com\\/(?:[^/]+\\/)?(?:p|reel|reels|tv)\\/([A-Za-z0-9_-]+)/);\n  return m ? m[1] : null;\n};\n\nconst errors = [];\nconst errorByLoc = {};\nconst postsByLoc = {};\nfor (const it of items) {\n  if (it._kind === 'error') {\n    errors.push({ location: it.locationName, message: it.message });\n    errorByLoc[String(it.locationId)] = it.message;\n  } else if (it._kind === 'post') {\n    (postsByLoc[String(it.locationId)] = postsByLoc[String(it.locationId)] || []).push(it);\n  }\n}\n\nconst stats = { scanned: 0, alreadySeen: 0, tooOld: 0, formatFiltered: 0 };\nconst seenThisRun = new Set();\nconst newPosts = [];\nconst locationRows = [];\n\nfor (const loc of locations) {\n  const key = String(loc.locationId);\n  if (errorByLoc[key] !== undefined) {\n    // Keep watermark and recent IDs untouched so nothing is lost; just record the failure\n    locationRows.push({\n      'Location ID': loc.locationId,\n      'Last Checked At': nowIso,\n      'Last Run Status': 'error: ' + String(errorByLoc[key]).slice(0, 150),\n      'New Posts Last Run': 0\n    });\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  const recent = new Set(loc.recentIds);\n  const cutoffMs = Date.parse(loc.cutoff);\n  let newestMs = Date.parse(loc.lastPostAt) || 0;\n  const idsThisRun = [];\n  let found = 0;\n\n  for (const p of postsByLoc[key] || []) {\n    stats.scanned++;\n    const id = postIdFromUrl(p.url) || p.url;\n    if (!id) continue;\n    idsThisRun.push(id);\n\n    const t = Date.parse(p.posted_at);\n    if (!isNaN(t) && t > newestMs) newestMs = t;\n\n    if (recent.has(id) || seenThisRun.has(id)) { stats.alreadySeen++; continue; }\n    seenThisRun.add(id);\n    if (!isNaN(t) && !isNaN(cutoffMs) && t < cutoffMs) { stats.tooOld++; continue; }\n\n    const isReel = /\\/(reel|reels|tv)\\//.test(String(p.url)) || p.is_video === true;\n    if ((formats === 'reels' && !isReel) || (formats === 'photos' && isReel)) { stats.formatFiltered++; continue; }\n\n    newPosts.push({\n      id,\n      url: p.url,\n      postedAt: p.posted_at || '',\n      locationId: loc.locationId,\n      locationName: loc.locationName,\n      format: isReel ? 'Reel' : 'Photo',\n      isReel,\n      author: String(p.author || ''),\n      authorId: p.author_id ? String(p.author_id) : '',\n      caption: String(p.caption || ''),\n      hashtags: Array.isArray(p.hashtags) ? p.hashtags : [],\n      likes: typeof p.likes === 'number' ? p.likes : null\n    });\n    found++;\n  }\n\n  locationRows.push({\n    'Location ID': loc.locationId,\n    'Last Post At': newestMs ? new Date(newestMs).toISOString() : '',\n    'Recent Post IDs': [...new Set([...idsThisRun, ...loc.recentIds])].slice(0, KEEP_IDS).join(','),\n    'Last Checked At': nowIso,\n    'Last Run Status': 'ok',\n    'New Posts Last Run': found\n  });\n}\n\nnewPosts.sort((a, b) => String(a.postedAt).localeCompare(String(b.postedAt)));\nconst profileUrl = u => u ? `https://www.instagram.com/${u}/` : '';\n\n// ---- Posts tab (append-only log) ----\nconst postRows = newPosts.map(p => ({\n  'Post ID': p.id,\n  'Posted At': p.postedAt,\n  'First Seen At': nowIso,\n  'Location': p.locationName,\n  'Location ID': p.locationId,\n  'Format': p.format,\n  'Author': p.author,\n  'Author ID': p.authorId,\n  'Profile URL': profileUrl(p.author),\n  'Caption': p.caption.slice(0, 1000),\n  'Hashtags': p.hashtags.map(h => '#' + h).join(' '),\n  'Likes at Discovery': p.likes === null ? '' : p.likes,\n  'Post URL': p.url\n}));\n\n// ---- Creators tab (lead list) ----\n// Data minimisation: an account only enters the list once it qualifies\n// (one post with >= leadMinLikes, or >= regularThreshold posts in a single run).\nconst existing = new Map();\nfor (const r of $('Fetch Creators from Sheets').all()) {\n  const j = r.json || {};\n  const k = String(j['Author ID'] ?? '').trim();\n  if (k) existing.set(k, j);\n}\n\nconst byAuthor = new Map();\nfor (const p of newPosts) {\n  if (!p.authorId) continue;\n  if (!byAuthor.has(p.authorId)) byAuthor.set(p.authorId, []);\n  byAuthor.get(p.authorId).push(p);\n}\n\nconst creatorRows = [];\nconst newLeads = [];\nconst newRegulars = [];\n\nfor (const [authorId, posts] of byAuthor) {\n  const prev = existing.get(authorId);\n  const likes = posts.map(p => p.likes).filter(n => typeof n === 'number');\n  const runMax = likes.length ? Math.max(...likes) : 0;\n  if (!prev && runMax < leadMinLikes && posts.length < regularThreshold) continue;\n\n  const prevPosts = prev ? num(prev['Posts Seen'], 0) : 0;\n  const postsSeen = prevPosts + posts.length;\n  const reelsSeen = (prev ? num(prev['Reels Seen'], 0) : 0) + posts.filter(p => p.isReel).length;\n  const totalLikes = (prev ? num(prev['Total Likes'], 0) : 0) + likes.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\n\n  let bestUrl = prev ? String(prev['Best Post URL'] || '') : '';\n  let bestLikes = prev ? num(prev['Best Post Likes'], 0) : 0;\n  for (const p of posts) if (typeof p.likes === 'number' && p.likes > bestLikes) { bestLikes = p.likes; bestUrl = p.url; }\n\n  const locs = new Set(String((prev && prev['Locations']) || '').split(';').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean));\n  posts.forEach(p => locs.add(p.locationName));\n\n  const avgLikes = postsSeen ? Math.round(totalLikes / postsSeen) : 0;\n  const tier = postsSeen >= regularThreshold ? 'Regular' : (bestLikes >= viralLikes ? 'Notable' : 'Lead');\n  const score = Math.round(avgLikes * Math.log2(1 + postsSeen) * (1 + 0.25 * (locs.size - 1)));\n  const username = posts[posts.length - 1].author;\n\n  const row = {\n    'Author ID': authorId,\n    'Username': username,\n    'Profile URL': profileUrl(username),\n    'Posts Seen': postsSeen,\n    'Reels Seen': reelsSeen,\n    'Total Likes': totalLikes,\n    'Avg Likes': avgLikes,\n    'Best Post URL': bestUrl,\n    'Best Post Likes': bestLikes,\n    'Locations': [...locs].join('; '),\n    'Last Seen At': nowIso,\n    'Tier': tier,\n    'Score': score\n  };\n  if (!prev) {\n    // Only set for new rows, so a manually edited outreach status is never overwritten\n    row['First Seen At'] = nowIso;\n    row['Outreach Status'] = 'New';\n    newLeads.push({ username, profile: profileUrl(username), avgLikes, postsSeen, locations: row['Locations'] });\n  }\n  if (prevPosts < regularThreshold && postsSeen >= regularThreshold) {\n    newRegulars.push({ username, profile: profileUrl(username), postsSeen, avgLikes, locations: row['Locations'] });\n  }\n  creatorRows.push(row);\n}\n\n// ---- Telegram material ----\nconst viral = newPosts\n  .filter(p => typeof p.likes === 'number' && p.likes >= viralLikes)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.likes - a.likes)\n  .map(p => ({ url: p.url, likes: p.likes, format: p.format, author: p.author, location: p.locationName }));\n\nconst digest = locations\n  .map(loc => {\n    const ps = newPosts.filter(p => p.locationId === loc.locationId);\n    const top = [...ps].sort((a, b) => (b.likes || 0) - (a.likes || 0)).slice(0, 3)\n      .map(p => ({ url: p.url, likes: p.likes, author: p.author, format: p.format }));\n    return { location: loc.locationName, count: ps.length, reels: ps.filter(p => p.isReel).length, top };\n  })\n  .filter(d => d.count > 0);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    postRows,\n    creatorRows,\n    locationRows,\n    viral,\n    newRegulars,\n    newLeads,\n    digest,\n    errors,\n    stats,\n    totals: { newPosts: newPosts.length, newReels: newPosts.filter(p => p.isReel).length },\n    locationsChecked: locations.length,\n    isManual: $execution.mode === 'manual',\n    sendDigest: cfg.sendDigest === true || cfg.sendDigest === 'true',\n    telegramChatId: cfg.telegramChatId,\n    sheetUrl: cfg.sheetUrl\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"3124071c-3f90-4bf9-894a-86a9f51a60e0","name":"If New Posts Exist","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[5696,864],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"97a8c2b8-00b2-413a-a2cc-c531cd2243ce","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.postRows.length > 0 ? 'yes' : 'no' }}","rightValue":"yes"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"32670efa-c01e-4131-9a7b-b8e6e3dfe998","name":"Split Posts into Rows","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitOut","position":[5920,736],"parameters":{"options":{},"fieldToSplitOut":"postRows"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8cf214cf-ce7a-4e85-bf61-3e4a0b530bbf","name":"Add Posts to Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[6144,736],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{"cellFormat":"RAW"},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Posts"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"f1fe9e10-6129-40e7-92dc-6a6e2e06b147","name":"Restore Post Summary Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[6352,736],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// The Sheets node outputs one item per row; continue with the single summary item.\nreturn [$('Analyze New Instagram Posts').first()];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"012df229-c848-4cc4-91b2-b43ebe15cb92","name":"If Creator Updates Exist","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[6576,864],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"b0d8834d-e019-43a0-abe6-6b9c1748622d","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.creatorRows.length > 0 ? 'yes' : 'no' }}","rightValue":"yes"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"845a7f4c-10a2-4ef5-82cc-7859019acebf","name":"Divide Creator Data Rows","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitOut","position":[6800,736],"parameters":{"options":{},"fieldToSplitOut":"creatorRows"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1ebf63ca-0e04-494c-a175-1588dc5817f4","name":"Update Creators in Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[7024,736],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":["Author ID"]},"options":{"cellFormat":"RAW"},"operation":"appendOrUpdate","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Creators"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"7c0e75d0-fbbb-43e7-a406-3301f99a6e57","name":"Restore Creator Summary Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[7232,736],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// The Sheets node outputs one item per row; continue with the single summary item.\nreturn [$('Analyze New Instagram Posts').first()];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"cb11df71-e080-4d7b-a1c9-9b784733c658","name":"Separate Location State Rows","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitOut","position":[7456,960],"parameters":{"options":{},"fieldToSplitOut":"locationRows"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"f9bed6e9-95c5-4063-bdba-15dc608b0db4","name":"Modify Location State in Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[7664,960],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":["Location ID"]},"options":{"cellFormat":"RAW"},"operation":"appendOrUpdate","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Locations"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"a5f217a6-3f5c-4a5c-82dc-698d9807435c","name":"Notify Sheet Write Failure","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[7632,1328],"webhookId":"a177b901-207a-4ad8-9503-ff648a0eba3a","parameters":{"text":"=❌ <b>Google Sheets write failed</b> in \"{{ $prevNode.name }}\".\n\nLocation state was not advanced, so the posts will be picked up again on the next run.\n\nError: {{ String($json.error && ($json.error.message || $json.error)).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').slice(0, 300) }}","chatId":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.telegramChatId }}","additionalFields":{"parse_mode":"HTML","appendAttribution":false,"disable_web_page_preview":true}},"credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Telegram account"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"30260e73-b9b2-474d-81c5-ccad7f781f98","name":"Compose Telegram Alerts","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[7888,864],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Compose Telegram messages in HTML mode (usernames and captions are escaped).\nconst s = $('Analyze New Instagram Posts').first().json;\nconst chatId = s.telegramChatId;\nconst esc = t => String(t === null || t === undefined ? '' : t)\n  .replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/\"/g, '&quot;');\nconst sheetLink = /^https?:\\/\\//.test(s.sheetUrl || '') ? `\\n\\n<a href=\"${esc(s.sheetUrl)}\">Open sheet</a>` : '';\nconst MAX_LEN = 3500;\nconst messages = [];\nconst push = (text, preview = false) => messages.push({ chatId, text, preview });\n\n// 1) High-engagement posts: instant, with preview (max 5 per run)\nfor (const v of s.viral.slice(0, 5)) {\n  push(`🔥 <b>High-engagement ${v.format.toLowerCase()} at ${esc(v.location)}</b>\\n\\n${v.likes} likes at discovery · by @${esc(v.author)}\\n\\n${esc(v.url)}`, true);\n}\n\n// 2) Creators who just became regulars at your locations\nfor (const c of s.newRegulars.slice(0, 5)) {\n  push(`⭐ <b>@${esc(c.username)} is now a regular</b>\\n\\n${c.postsSeen} posts at ${esc(c.locations)} · avg ${c.avgLikes} likes\\n\\n${esc(c.profile)}`);\n}\n\n// 3) Digest of everything new this run\nif (s.sendDigest && s.totals.newPosts > 0) {\n  const lines = [];\n  for (const d of s.digest) {\n    lines.push(`\\n<b>📍 ${esc(d.location)}</b>: ${d.count} new (${d.reels} reels)`);\n    for (const p of d.top) {\n      lines.push(`• <a href=\"${esc(p.url)}\">${p.format}</a> by @${esc(p.author)}${typeof p.likes === 'number' ? ` · ${p.likes} ♥` : ''}`);\n    }\n  }\n  if (s.newLeads.length > 0) {\n    lines.push(`\\n<b>🆕 New creator leads (${s.newLeads.length})</b>`);\n    for (const c of s.newLeads.slice(0, 10)) lines.push(`• <a href=\"${esc(c.profile)}\">@${esc(c.username)}</a> · avg ${c.avgLikes} ♥`);\n    if (s.newLeads.length > 10) lines.push(`…and ${s.newLeads.length - 10} more in the Creators tab.`);\n  }\n  const header = `📸 <b>${s.totals.newPosts} new post${s.totals.newPosts === 1 ? '' : 's'}</b> (${s.totals.newReels} reels) across ${s.digest.length} location${s.digest.length === 1 ? '' : 's'}`;\n  let chunk = header;\n  for (const line of lines) {\n    if ((chunk + '\\n' + line).length > MAX_LEN) { push(chunk); chunk = header + ' (cont.)'; }\n    chunk += '\\n' + line;\n  }\n  push(chunk + sheetLink);\n}\n\n// 4) One combined warning for failed locations\nif (s.errors.length > 0) {\n  const lines = s.errors.map(e => `• ${esc(e.location)}: ${esc(e.message)}`);\n  push(`⚠️ <b>${s.errors.length} of ${s.locationsChecked} location search${s.locationsChecked === 1 ? '' : 'es'} failed</b>\\n\\n${lines.join('\\n')}\\n\\nState for these locations was kept, so nothing is skipped on the next run.`);\n}\n\n// 5) Manual test run with nothing to report: health check\nif (messages.length === 0 && s.isManual) {\n  const st = s.stats;\n  push(`✅ <b>Test run complete</b>\\n\\nLocations checked: ${s.locationsChecked}\\nPosts scanned: ${st.scanned}\\nNew: ${s.totals.newPosts} · already seen: ${st.alreadySeen} · older than cutoff: ${st.tooOld} · format-filtered: ${st.formatFiltered}\\nCreator rows updated: ${s.creatorRows.length}${sheetLink}`);\n}\n\nreturn messages.map(m => ({ json: m }));"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"35e8a9c7-5fb1-4814-bbfa-3d7cfcd05bf0","name":"Dispatch Telegram Notifications","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[8096,864],"webhookId":"fccdcee4-acd9-4fb1-98e0-5968bb899c8a","parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.text }}","chatId":"={{ $json.chatId }}","additionalFields":{"parse_mode":"HTML","appendAttribution":false,"disable_web_page_preview":"={{ !$json.preview }}"}},"credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Telegram account"}},"typeVersion":1.2}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"b59bf51a-5cb0-4fa8-991a-f609a328e44b","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"If Setup Required":{"main":[[{"node":"Notify Setup Reminder via Telegram","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Fetch Creators from Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Log Search Errors":{"main":[[{"node":"Process Locations in Batches","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Create Search Jobs":{"main":[[{"node":"Process Locations in Batches","type":"main","index":0}]]},"If Locations Found":{"main":[[{"node":"Select Locations Form","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Form No Match Acknowledgment","type":"main","index":0}]]},"If New Posts Exist":{"main":[[{"node":"Split Posts into Rows","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"If Creator Updates Exist","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Add Posts to Sheets":{"main":[[{"node":"Restore Post Summary Data","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Notify Sheet Write Failure","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch Location Data":{"main":[[{"node":"Generate Location Choices","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Form Lookup Failed Acknowledgment","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Select Locations Form":{"main":[[{"node":"Prepare Rows for Locations","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Split Posts into Rows":{"main":[[{"node":"Add Posts to Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Compose Telegram Alerts":{"main":[[{"node":"Dispatch Telegram Notifications","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch Posts by Location":{"main":[[{"node":"Assign Location Tags to Results","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Log Search Errors","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Divide Creator Data Rows":{"main":[[{"node":"Update Creators in Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Every 30 Minutes Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Configuration Parameters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"If Creator Updates Exist":{"main":[[{"node":"Divide Creator Data Rows","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Separate Location State Rows","type":"main","index":0}]]},"If Setup Form Submission":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Location Data","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Read Locations from Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Generate Location Choices":{"main":[[{"node":"If Locations Found","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Restore Post Summary Data":{"main":[[{"node":"If Creator Updates Exist","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Update Creators in Sheets":{"main":[[{"node":"Restore Creator Summary Data","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"